## Savepoints Lite (session logging)

This repository uses `@multipliers-dev/savepoints-lite` for append-only session Savepoints via Notion MCP.

After `npm ci`, agents must read the **installed** router skill (not vendored `skills/` copies):

`node_modules/@multipliers-dev/savepoints-lite/skills/savepoints/SKILL.md`

Follow the router each turn when work events match its triggers. Cursor loads `.cursor/rules/savepoints-lite.mdc` (`alwaysApply: true`) for the same contract.
